    "proto": "pppoe",
    "summary": "T-1 全生命周期（smoke 改写，等价覆盖+PADT 重校准 7→8）：[ip,pppoe{}] 空业务面→PADI/PADO/PADR/PADS(缺省ID1)/LCP req/ack/1×IPv4 data/PADT(0xa7,ID回显,up)。RFC 2516 §5+§5.6",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
