    "proto": "pppoe",
    "summary": "T-9 空 Service-Name=零长标签 any-service（现网语义：客户端不挑服务）：PADI/PADO/PADR/PADS 四帧均 01 01 00 00",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
